    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL INDIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the untouched depths of <strong>Northeastern India,</strong>\u00a0where a forgotten forest whispers with ancient secrets. From <strong>abandoned tribal settlements</strong> to <strong>sacred natural spaces</strong>, explore a world lost to time\u2014shrouded in fog, silence, and stories untold. Feel the weight of every step through immersive soundscapes, dynamic lighting, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AWAKEN THE MOTHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a land where the <strong>Panch Tatvas</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>Five Elements of Nature</strong>\u2014 <strong>Prithvi (Earth), Jal (Water), Vaayu (Air), Aakash (Space), and Agni (Fire)</strong> have begun to fade. Solve cryptic puzzles, decode forgotten mantras, and restore balance to a dying forest. Every discovery brings you closer to the truth\u2026 and deeper into the forest\u2019s secrets</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE WHAT IS WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lurking in every corner of the forest is a <strong>vikar (vice) born from Kaliyug (The Era of Darkness in Hinduism)</strong>\u2014<strong>Kaam (Lust), Krodh (Anger), Lobh (Greed), Moh (Attachment), Mad (Ego), and Irsha (Envy).</strong> These aren\u2019t monsters. They\u2019re reflections of humanity at its worst, told through <strong>psychological horror, atmospheric storytelling, and real social commentary.</strong> Confront not just what\u2019s around you\u2014but what\u2019s within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through natural mazes, decode riddles that challenge your mind, answer questions which unlock doors for you, solve puzzles, find ways and at last try to escape which you won't be able to</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL INDIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the untouched depths of <strong>Northeastern India,</strong>\u00a0where a forgotten forest whispers with ancient secrets. From <strong>abandoned tribal settlements</strong> to <strong>sacred natural spaces</strong>, explore a world lost to time\u2014shrouded in fog, silence, and stories untold. Feel the weight of every step through immersive soundscapes, dynamic lighting, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AWAKEN THE MOTHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a land where the <strong>Panch Tatvas</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>Five Elements of Nature</strong>\u2014 <strong>Prithvi (Earth), Jal (Water), Vaayu (Air), Aakash (Space), and Agni (Fire)</strong> have begun to fade. Solve cryptic puzzles, decode forgotten mantras, and restore balance to a dying forest. Every discovery brings you closer to the truth\u2026 and deeper into the forest\u2019s secrets</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE WHAT IS WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lurking in every corner of the forest is a <strong>vikar (vice) born from Kaliyug (The Era of Darkness in Hinduism)</strong>\u2014<strong>Kaam (Lust), Krodh (Anger), Lobh (Greed), Moh (Attachment), Mad (Ego), and Irsha (Envy).</strong> These aren\u2019t monsters. They\u2019re reflections of humanity at its worst, told through <strong>psychological horror, atmospheric storytelling, and real social commentary.</strong> Confront not just what\u2019s around you\u2014but what\u2019s within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through natural mazes, decode riddles that challenge your mind, answer questions which unlock doors for you, solve puzzles, find ways and at last try to escape which you won't be able to</p>",
